[{"kind":1,"language":"markdown","value":"# XPath Notebook"},{"kind":1,"language":"markdown","value":"## 1. Open `out/tei/complete/Planetes1.xml` to make it the context node."},{"kind":1,"language":"markdown","value":"## 2. Find all `<choice>` elements with `<abbr>` children."},{"kind":2,"language":"xpath","value":"//choice[abbr]"},{"kind":1,"language":"markdown","value":"## 3. Exclude empty `<abbr>` elements, `<sic>` elements, `<orig>` elements, and `<note>` elements."},{"kind":2,"language":"xpath","value":"//choice[abbr[.!='']][not(ancestor::sic)][not(ancestor::orig)][not(ancestor::note)]"},{"kind":1,"language":"markdown","value":"## 4. Get the text of the selected `<abbr>` elements."},{"kind":2,"language":"xpath","value":"//choice[abbr[.!='']][not(ancestor::sic)][not(ancestor::orig)][not(ancestor::note)]/abbr! string()"},{"kind":1,"language":"markdown","value":"## 5. Count the number of selected `<abbr>` elements."},{"kind":2,"language":"xpath","value":"count(//choice[abbr[.!='']][not(ancestor::sic)][not(ancestor::orig)][not(ancestor::note)]/abbr)"}]